16. What is Java Collections Framework? List out some benefits of Collections Framework.
The Java Collections Framework (JCF) is a set of classes and interfaces used to store, manipulate, 
and process groups of objects efficiently.
Benefits:
* Reduces programming effort
* Provides reusable data structures
* Increases performance
* Supports generic programming
